{"title":"2015 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A company builds cylinders. Its Model A cylinder has radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/3/593cebfe2f4feac91cf23dfc53f17cb2efc5f235.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" /> cm and height <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/0/a2062939a88eb6056ea6d7a9ebd30a5ff002efa9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" /> cm.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Volume of a Cylinder: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/1/44184a0036f93527b56504656042f5e7ca069040.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$V = \\pi r^{2}h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The company makes a rectangular box, called Box A, that holds six Model A cylinders. The cylinders are placed into the box vertically and tightly packed, as shown.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Determine the volume in cm<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/c/25c4e02a8795765cffe4761629c2c3c1767ca422.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{}^{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"9\" height=\"17\" /> of Box A.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018000344\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 44/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1822/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 715/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   20.161      1 -total\n 65.40%   13.185      1 2015_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\n 31.38%    6.326      1 Template:Solution\n 27.08%    5.460      2 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36963:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018000344 and revision id 285861. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}